			"widgets_values":[
				"A cinematic Disney-Pixar style 3D animated short scene in a sun-dappled \nautumn park during warm golden hour. The setting features an old weathered \ndark wooden park bench with peeling paint beneath a massive maple tree \nblazing with vibrant orange, amber and yellow leaves, a soft bokeh \nbackground of more autumn foliage with a distant glowing vintage lamppost \non the right. Fallen maple leaves are scattered across the bench and the \nground. Two children are the focus: on the left, a young girl named Lily \nwith voluminous fiery red-orange curly hair, big bright emerald green eyes, \nsoft freckles across her nose and cheeks, fair skin with rosy cheeks, \nwearing a buttercup-yellow floral-patterned sundress with a crisp white \npeter-pan collar and two small white buttons, white canvas sneakers. On \nthe right, a young boy named Max with messy fluffy chestnut-brown hair, \nbright sky-blue eyes, light warm skin with rosy cheeks, wearing blue denim \noveralls with brass buttons and cuffed legs over a red-and-white horizontal \nstriped t-shirt, brown leather sneakers. Painterly textures, rich warm \ncolor palette, expressive cartoon faces with subsurface scattering, soft \ngolden rim light, cinematic shallow depth of field, gentle floating dust \nparticles in the sunbeams.",
				330,
				13.2,
				"{\"segments\":[{\"id\":\"1780306849507xxpu8\",\"start\":0,\"length\":73,\"prompt\":\"The little boy read with extraordinary concentration, fully immersed in the fascinating world of the story, completely unaware of any noise or disturbance around him. As the plot unfolded step by step, he grew more and more captivated. He could not help leaning slightly forward, bringing the book gently closer to his eyes. His gaze was tightly fixed on the pages, becoming increasingly devoted and absorbed in the tale.\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"c43e566bff3be634d878df99576fa5e29445b6cf25fc7f2f51ad92f851496a37.jpg\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=c43e566bff3be634d878df99576fa5e29445b6cf25fc7f2f51ad92f851496a37.jpg&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJkYzFmOWZhNDYzZGNhNzI2MDg1NThmOWQzYjg3NTBmYiIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA5MTE2MzIyODYsInRzIjoxNzgwMzA2ODMyMjg2LCJzaWduIjoiNjJlOWU2OWMzZjRmODMwMjM1OTQ3ODlhYjFlNmE3ZjgifQ==&Rh-Identify=dc1f9fa463dca72608558f9d3b8750fb\"},{\"id\":\"1780305302965lrmxz\",\"start\":73,\"length\":81,\"prompt\":\"Just as he was enjoying the story, something magical happened suddenly. The monster printed on the page, which had been completely still, began to move slowly. It twisted its body as if trying to break free from the pages, vividly appearing right in front of the little boy.\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"8080886d51aae3c007e89e69a08fac909897ce4116203e55ed377649e6275bc1.jpg\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=8080886d51aae3c007e89e69a08fac909897ce4116203e55ed377649e6275bc1.jpg&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJkYzFmOWZhNDYzZGNhNzI2MDg1NThmOWQzYjg3NTBmYiIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA5MDk4MTc4MjIsInRzIjoxNzgwMzA1MDE3ODIyLCJzaWduIjoiNzE3MjhlYTIyMWE1NDE1YTIxN2VmZDAyNzMzODI4ZTMifQ==&Rh-Identify=dc1f9fa463dca72608558f9d3b8750fb\"},{\"id\":\"1780305310097deyjt\",\"start\":154,\"length\":95,\"prompt\":\"Faced with the sudden monster, the little boy showed no fear at all. He stared fiercely and firmly at the creature in the book, his eyes filled with courage and determination. To defeat the monster and protect the wonderful world inside the book, the little boy instantly transformed into a brave and righteous superhero.\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"28b241df815679526a7486234e8d6656a78a76d3dd7483c941c1e86a89496346.jpg\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=28b241df815679526a7486234e8d6656a78a76d3dd7483c941c1e86a89496346.jpg&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJkYzFmOWZhNDYzZGNhNzI2MDg1NThmOWQzYjg3NTBmYiIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA5MDk4MTc4MjIsInRzIjoxNzgwMzA1MDE3ODIyLCJzaWduIjoiNzE3MjhlYTIyMWE1NDE1YTIxN2VmZDAyNzMzODI4ZTMifQ==&Rh-Identify=dc1f9fa463dca72608558f9d3b8750fb\"},{\"id\":\"1780305316296x2xqv\",\"start\":249,\"length\":90,\"prompt\":\" his superhero suit and filled with powerful strength, he leaped without hesitation, diving straight into the magical world of the book, ready to face the monster and embark on a brave new adventure.\",\"type\":\"image\",\"imageFile\":\"0f6c3fe25fccf24fb8b8beed805fd61fc80c363a3cf67c2ac83d8a84ac997d49.jpg\",\"imageB64\":\"/view?filename=0f6c3fe25fccf24fb8b8beed805fd61fc80c363a3cf67c2ac83d8a84ac997d49.jpg&type=input&subfolder=&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJkYzFmOWZhNDYzZGNhNzI2MDg1NThmOWQzYjg3NTBmYiIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODA5MDk4MTc4MjIsInRzIjoxNzgwMzA1MDE3ODIyLCJzaWduIjoiNzE3MjhlYTIyMWE1NDE1YTIxN2VmZDAyNzMzODI4ZTMifQ==&Rh-Identify=dc1f9fa463dca72608558f9d3b8750fb\"},{\"id\":\"178030541553942a0r\",\"start\":339,\"length\":53,\"prompt\":\"\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"id\":\"1780305426355w5ob0\",\"start\":398,\"length\":30,\"prompt\":\"小男孩正在看一本关于英雄的书籍，看的非常的仔细\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"audioSegments\":[]}",
				"The little boy read with extraordinary concentration, fully immersed in the fascinating world of the story, completely unaware of any noise or disturbance around him. As the plot unfolded step by step, he grew more and more captivated. He could not help leaning slightly forward, bringing the book gently closer to his eyes. His gaze was tightly fixed on the pages, becoming increasingly devoted and absorbed in the tale. | Just as he was enjoying the story, something magical happened suddenly. The monster printed on the page, which had been completely still, began to move slowly. It twisted its body as if trying to break free from the pages, vividly appearing right in front of the little boy. | Faced with the sudden monster, the little boy showed no fear at all. He stared fiercely and firmly at the creature in the book, his eyes filled with courage and determination. To defeat the monster and protect the wonderful world inside the book, the little boy instantly transformed into a brave and righteous superhero. |  his superhero suit and filled with powerful strength, he leaped without hesitation, diving straight into the magical world of the book, ready to face the monster and embark on a brave new adventure.",
